WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.583
Hey everyone,

00:00:00.583 --> 00:00:03.166
welcome to the Gridiron Heights Christmas party!

00:00:03.166 --> 00:00:04.416
Keep in mind layoffs are coming.

00:00:04.416 --> 00:00:04.916
Oh no.

00:00:04.916 --> 00:00:05.708
I’m freaking out.

00:00:05.708 --> 00:00:06.291
No. No. No.

00:00:06.291 --> 00:00:07.166
I’m not being replaced.

00:00:07.166 --> 00:00:07.875
I’m still hurt.

00:00:07.875 --> 00:00:08.291
See!

00:00:08.291 --> 00:00:08.791
OW!

00:00:08.791 --> 00:00:09.708
Santa Gruden,

00:00:09.708 --> 00:00:12.208
I’m giving all my players away, OK?

00:00:12.208 --> 00:00:13.875
And an Amari for you.

00:00:13.875 --> 00:00:15.125
WOAH, A RECEIVER!

00:00:15.125 --> 00:00:16.416
I’ve never had one before.

00:00:16.416 --> 00:00:17.750
Hey, who wants a Derek Carr?!

00:00:17.750 --> 00:00:19.125
Hey, how about you, Dan Snyder, man?

00:00:19.125 --> 00:00:21.041
He’s only $125 million?!

00:00:21.041 --> 00:00:22.166
Oh, can I, Jerry?

00:00:22.166 --> 00:00:22.958
Please?!

00:00:25.625 --> 00:00:27.000
OK, Odell, this is a work event.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:27.875
Behave yourself.

00:00:28.750 --> 00:00:29.041
WOOO!

00:00:29.041 --> 00:00:30.833
I HAVE STRONG OPINIONS ABOUT ALL OF YOU!

00:00:31.208 --> 00:00:32.000
That’s a fine-

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:33.916
HEY, WOAH WOAH ZEKE, I’LL FINE YOU TOO-

00:00:33.916 --> 00:00:34.541
THANK YOU.

00:00:34.541 --> 00:00:35.666
I just came to get my stuff.

00:00:35.666 --> 00:00:37.166
You’re having a party without me?

00:00:38.458 --> 00:00:40.208
I’m having the time of my life.

00:00:40.208 --> 00:00:41.291
I’m back!

00:00:41.291 --> 00:00:44.166
Gronk may be too old for this.

00:00:44.750 --> 00:00:45.916
OK, the NFC's a mess.

00:00:45.916 --> 00:00:46.666
YEAH IT IS.

00:00:46.666 --> 00:00:47.666
Where’s Eli?

00:00:47.666 --> 00:00:48.750
Oh, he’s babysitting.

00:00:48.833 --> 00:00:49.583
PEW! PEW!

00:00:49.583 --> 00:00:50.958
LET’S PRETEND PLAYOFFS!

00:00:50.958 --> 00:00:51.625
NO!

00:00:51.625 --> 00:00:53.000
I’M GOING FOR REAL!

00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:54.375
IF YOU GUYS DON’T GO TO BED,

00:00:54.375 --> 00:00:55.500
SANTA WON’T COME.

00:00:55.500 --> 00:00:57.083
I’M TALL, BUT I CAN RUN.

00:00:57.083 --> 00:01:00.000
WHY ARE THESE KIDS SO MOBILE?!

